WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.208
ANITA KIBUNGUCHY: Discovering
enterprise data sources

00:00:02.208 --> 00:00:04.110
is a time-consuming
challenge and is usually

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:06.090
based on tribal knowledge.

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:09.481
Data discovery is now made
simple with Data Catalog.

00:00:09.481 --> 00:00:12.848
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:23.610
Data Catalog is a fully managed
and scalable data discovery

00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:27.030
and metadata management service
that empowers organizations

00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:30.300
to quickly discover,
understand, and manage

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.220
all their data in Google Cloud.

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:35.220
I am Anita Kibunguchy,
and today, we'll

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:37.830
be tackling data discovery
with Data Catalog.

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:41.010
Data discovery usually
starts with a question.

00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:44.070
What's the slowest link
in our supply chain?

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:45.690
How many of our
retail customers are

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:49.860
within driving distance to
our competitors' new flagship?

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:51.480
Where do monarch
butterflies stop

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:53.640
during their annual migration?

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:56.670
Unfortunately, users
spend an incredible amount

00:00:56.670 --> 00:01:00.600
of time and effort discovering,
validating, and getting access

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:03.780
to the correct data sets
and sources, and to be

00:01:03.780 --> 00:01:05.400
able to answer their questions.

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:07.590
But thanks to the
same technology

00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:10.920
that powers Gmail and
Drive, Data Catalog

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:14.940
provides a simple and
easy-to-use user interface

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:17.480
with powerful, structured
search capabilities

00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:20.860
to quickly and easily
find data assets.

00:01:20.860 --> 00:01:23.070
So now, let's see it in action.

00:01:23.070 --> 00:01:25.830
Using the search bar at
the top of Data Catalog,

00:01:25.830 --> 00:01:27.810
you can conduct a
search of all your data

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:31.255
assets across BigQuery
and Cloud Pub/Sub.

00:01:31.255 --> 00:01:32.880
We'll be adding
additional data sources

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:35.490
in the future,
including on-prem.

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:38.790
Data Catalog also
provides faceted search,

00:01:38.790 --> 00:01:42.030
allowing users to
search by type, column,

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:45.450
and tag across literally
millions of data assets.

00:01:45.450 --> 00:01:48.540
Beyond the search bar, you
can view popular tables,

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:51.120
which span the most queried
and viewed BigQuery tables

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:53.530
in the past 30 days.

00:01:53.530 --> 00:01:56.610
You can also explore Pub/Sub
topics, as well as tables

00:01:56.610 --> 00:01:58.620
and views, and
actually get started

00:01:58.620 --> 00:02:00.480
with creating tag templates.

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:03.090
The beauty of Data Catalog is
that it has built-in access

00:02:03.090 --> 00:02:06.780
level controls which honor
source ACLs, allowing users

00:02:06.780 --> 00:02:09.539
to get started with data
exploration in a seamless

00:02:09.539 --> 00:02:11.070
and more secure way.

00:02:11.070 --> 00:02:12.640
Thank you so much for watching.

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:14.630
And please check out
our Data Catalog videos,

00:02:14.630 --> 00:02:16.350
or visit our website
to learn more.

00:02:16.350 --> 00:02:19.500
[MUSIC PLAYING]

